            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Listeler; <code>17</code> gibi dize, boolean, kayan noktalı sayı veya tam sayı fark etmeksizin her tür veriyi depolayabilir.</p><p><code>17</code> tam sayısını listedeki ilk sıcaklık olarak depola.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;17&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"17.0\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>17</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
