            "title": "Index",
            "id": 79587,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İndeksler sıfırdan başlar ve sonraki her değerle birlikte artar. Bu, <code>temperatures</code> dizisindeki ikinci öğenin <code>[1]</code> indeksinde olduğu anlamına gelir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temperatures[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"20\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>[</code>, ardından <code>1</code> ve son olarak <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İndeksler sıfırdan başlar ve sonraki her değerle birlikte artar. Bu, <code>temperatures</code> dizisindeki ikinci öğenin <code>[1]</code> indeksinde olduğu anlamına gelir.</p><p>Konsolda <code>17</code> görüntülenecek şekilde ilk sıcaklığı yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temperatures\" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"17\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>[</code>, ardından <code>0</code> ve son olarak <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Access element",
            "id": 79588,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>26</code> öğesine erişmek için liste adı olan <code>temperatures</code> ifadesini ve ardından köşeli parantezler arasına öğenin indeksini <code>[2]</code> yazarak kodla.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temperatures[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[26]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"26\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>temperatures</code>, ardından <code>[2]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>26</code> öğesine erişmek için liste adı olan <code>temperatures</code> ifadesini ve ardından köşeli parantezler arasına öğenin indeksini <code>[2]</code> yazarak kodla.</p><p>Listenin son öğesi olan <code>24</code> değerini yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"temperatures\" /><text value=\"[\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[2]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[4]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[24]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"24\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>temperatures</code>, ardından <code>[3]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Change value",
            "id": 79573,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tekrar dene, hata buydu: '&gt;' beklenmeyen bir belirteç. Beklenen belirteç '='. 1. satır, 12. konum.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatures[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temperatures)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"52\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[ 17, 20, 25, 24 ]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>temperatures[2]</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>25</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir liste öğesini değiştirmek için listenin adını ve öğenin indeksini, ardından yeni değeri atamak için <code>=</code> kullan.</p><p>Listenin <code>[17, 20, 25, 24]</code> yazdırması için üçüncü sıcaklığı <code>25</code> olarak değiştir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatures[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temperatures)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"temperatures[3]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;25&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[17, 20, 25, 24]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>temperatures[2]</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>25</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
