            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Listede dört öğe olmasına rağmen, sayım sıfırdan başladığı için burada son indekse <code>3</code> kullanarak erişiyoruz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"temperatures = [\" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"26\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"24\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"temperatures[\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(temperatures)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[17, 25, 26, 20]\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>3</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
