            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>\"cat\"</code> yazarak ardından <code>\"dog\"</code> yaz ve <code>\"cat\"</code> öğesinin <code>0</code> dizininde, <code>\"dog\"</code> öğesinin ise <code>1</code> dizininde olduğundan emin ol.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"animals = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;cat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dog&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"animals\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>\"cat\"</code>, ardından <code>\"dog\"</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
